<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        Press <strong>Week</strong> to see Monday to Sunday of the week you're looking at. On a computer the seven days sit side
        by side; on a phone they're one under another. Today is outlined.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="Reading a day">
        <ul>
            <li>Under each day's name is how many parties and children it has, and how many people are on the published rota.</li>
            <li>Each party shows its arrival time, the birthday child and how many are coming. Provisional and cancelled parties
                carry a badge.</li>
            <li>Click a party to open it, or click the day's name to open that day's timeline.</li>
        </ul>
        <FluentText>
            The boxes along the top add up the whole week. <a href="/help/whats-on?topic=staff">Totals &amp; Staff</a> explains each one.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
